    <p>
      The final examination period is December 7 <ndash/> 11. The Registrar's
      Office schedules the final exam; the date and time for each section, as
      set by the Registrar, are copied in <xref ref="table-final-exam"/>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Your lowest midterm exam score is dropped; see
      <xref ref="drop-lowest-midterm" text="title"/>.
    </p>

    <p>
      <alert>Calculators of any kind are not permitted on the exams.</alert>
    </p>
